lass=\"vod_items col-12 offset-xl-1 col-xl-11 order-2 order-md-1\" >\n\t\t\t<h1>Showroom, Sheffield</h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"excerpt col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-8 col-xl-7 offset-xl-1 venue order-3 \" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"meta_bits right top\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"meta_bit director_country_release text-truncate venue_event\">15 Paternoster Row, Sheffield, S1 2BX - <a class=\"gmap_link\" href=\"#gmap\">view map ›</a></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<p> \n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"meta_bits right bottom\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"feed_divider\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10 col-xl-9 offset-xl-1 screening_schedule\" id=\"screening_schedule\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"screening_schedule_items\"><div class=\"item screening_schedule normal row g-0\">\n\t\t\t\t                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 order-1\">\n\t\t\t\t                        <h5><a href=\"https://japanesefilm.club/linda-linda-linda/\">Linda Linda Linda - 4K Restoration</a> - <a class=\"cinema_title\" href=\"https://japanesefilm.club/showroom-sheffield/\">Showroom, Sheffield</a></h5>\n\t\t\t\t                        \n\t\t\t\t                        <h6>Saturday 26/09/2026 20:15pm</h6>\n\t\t\t\t                        \n\t\t\t\t                    </div>\n\t\t\t\t                     <div class=\"gy-2 gy-md-0 col-12 col-md-2 order-4 order-md-2\">\n\t                                <div class=\"seven_day_button dark\"\"><a href=\"https://japanesefilm.club/seat-select/?scr_film=3479&scr_id=6a4e316e26570\" target=\"_self\">Buy Tickets</a></div>\n\t                            </div>\n\t\t\t\t                </div></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-8 offset-xl-1 col-xl-7 col-xxl-6 article_text tv\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"newsletter_box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Get Discount Tickets For Showroom, Sheffield Now!</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t<form class=\"user_registration advert\"  method=\"post\" action=\"https://japanesefilm.club/showroom-sheffield/\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cf-turnstile\" \n                        data-sitekey=\"0x4AAAAAADOa7z6oxF-yCNHC\" \n                        data-callback=\"onTurnstileSuccess\"\n                        data-theme=\"light\"></div>\n\n                        <input type=\"email\" name=\"email_address\" class=\"first_step_email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required=\"\">\n                        <input type=\"submit\" class=\"first_step_button\" value=\"Join now ›\">\n                    </form>\n                    <p>Sign up for the FREE Japanese Film Club newsletter now to gain access to discount and early access tickets to all our events. <span class=\"extra_text\"></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t</div><p>Showroom Cinema is one of the United Kingdom’s leading independent cinemas. For more than thirty years they have brought people together to discover film, share ideas, and feel part of Sheffield’s cultural life. Showroom Cinema sits within a landmark Art Deco building in the heart of the city and we welcome everyone.</p>\n<p>Showroom Cinema is operated by Sheffield Media and Exhibition Centre, a registered charity recognised and funded by the British Film Institute. Every ticket purchased and every coffee shared helps to support their cultural mission.</p>\n\t<div class=\"google_map\" id=\"gmap\">\n                        <iframe\n                            height=\"250\"\n                            frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border:0\"\n                            referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"\n                            src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyBJSQLszF9zjGkapwqGQ0H-Kefa_tIrzQk&q=15+Paternoster+Row,+Sheffield,+S1+2BX\" allowfullscreen>\n                        </iframe>\n                    </div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div></div></div><footer class=\"entry-footer\"></footer></arti